  ^{:line 1167} [^{:val 121 :doc "MisplacedLabel occurs when a break or continue label is not on a for,\nswitch, or select statement.\n\nExample:\n func f() {\n L:\n \ta := []int{1,2,3}\n \tfor _, e := range a {\n \t\tif e > 10 {\n \t\t\tbreak L\n \t\t}\n \t\tprintln(a)\n \t}\n }\n"} MisplacedLabel]







